-# NativeCapabilities — D06-SRV02 only
-
-Standalone native-only UWP diagnostic, NativeDiagnostics0.2.4.0, same approved
-identity/publisher/entry point, zero capabilities/MTA startup. A future install
-replaces0.2.3.0 and may retain old LocalState; no installation/signing authorized here.
-Accepted D00 and production LegacyForge remain separate/untouched.
-
-Accepted one HARDWARE11_0/BGRA device, one fixed1x1 RGBA8 texture, one explicit SRV.
-Both resource HRESULTs/non-null outputs and all accepted descriptor fields required.
-Then one ID3D11View::GetResource with nonnull output storage; method returns void,
-not HRESULT. Require nonnull ID3D11Resource. Query original texture and returned
-resource once each for __uuidof(IUnknown), exactly IID_IUnknown. Require S_OK and
-nonnull canonical outputs before comparing pointers. Log only boolean equality,
-not raw pointer addresses. Failed/null queries cannot compare two nulls as PASS.
-
-Temporary IUnknown refs leave inner scope before returned resource, before SRV,
-texture/context/device. Scoped markers prove owned-reference progression only,
-not complete driver memory reclamation. Missing/error output references still scoped.
-No pipeline binding, shaders, texel reads/writes, drawing/clear/copy/map/readback,
-RTV, swapchain/presentation, software fallback, repeated GPU loop, Java/JNI/Minecraft.
-
-Build from clean committed checkout with existing Windows MSVC14.44.35207 UWP
-libraries, SDK10.0.26100.0 C++/WinRT, PowerShell7, Python standard library:
+# NativeCapabilities - D06-SRV03 only
+
+Separate native-only UWP diagnostic, NativeDiagnostics 0.2.5.0, existing diagnostic
+identity CN=LegacyForgeDiagnostics, x64 App Id App, MTA startup, zero capabilities.
+A future owner-approved update replaces registered 0.2.4.0 and may retain stale
+LocalState. Accepted packages/evidence and production LegacyForge remain separate.
+
+One HARDWARE 11_0/BGRA device, one fixed 1x1 RGBA8 texture and one explicit SRV,
+using accepted descriptors and S_OK/nonnull/GetDesc checks. Then exactly one
+ID3D11DeviceChild::GetDevice on the SRV with nonnull output storage. It returns
+void, not HRESULT. Require nonnull ID3D11Device, query original and returned device
+once each for IID_IUnknown; require S_OK and nonnull before canonical equality.
+No GetResource call or previous case dispatch in this single-case build.
+
+Scoped ownership: temporary IUnknown references, returned device reference, SRV,
+texture, context, original device. Failure outputs are also scoped. Record only
+identity equality, not raw addresses; markers do not prove driver leak freedom.
+
+No pipeline binding, sampling, texel initialization/reads, shaders, draw/clear/copy/
+map/readback, render target, swapchain/presentation, WARP, retries or Java/JNI/Minecraft.
+
+Build from a clean committed checkout with existing MSVC 14.44.35207 UWP store CRT,
+Windows SDK 10.0.26100.0 C++/WinRT, PowerShell 7 and Python standard library:
 
 ```powershell
 pwsh -NoProfile -File .\diagnostics\NativeCapabilities\build.ps1
 ```
 
-Fresh ignored output directory; unsigned x64 APPX only, same3 native translation
-units/libraries. Eight unsafe configurations compiler-rejected; native/JNI locks
-retained and prior-case macros/activation dispatch excluded. No target code execution.
-
-Receipt schema v5 binds source/build/frozen references/identity/process/run UUIDs,
-device/texture/SRV HRESULTs, descriptors, returned-resource/QI results, equality,
-release order, memory/deadline/terminal result and6 package-member hashes. Normal:
-STARTED1 -> BEFORE_CREATE_DEVICE2 -> BEFORE_CREATE_TEXTURE3 -> BEFORE_CREATE_SRV4
--> BEFORE_GET_RESOURCE5 -> FINAL6. Independent original receipt/hash/photo/run
-required for hardware acceptance. PASS/FAILED/BLOCKED/INCONCLUSIVE/NOT EXECUTED differ.
-
-10s observational deadline/30s owner window; first terminal wins/late PASS denied.
-No GPU/GetResource/QI/release/file-call cancellation. Startup hash/write precedes timer.
-128KiB writer cap/100ms I/O lock/finite writes/temp-flush-atomic replacement; no hard
-OS-call timeout or power-loss proof. VERIFY_BY_RETRIEVAL requires original retrieval.
-Memory>=256MiB headroom and<=64MiB observed growth; not peak/leak/driver allocation cap.
-MessageDialog is platform UI, not app rendering; async UI errors remain a limitation.
-
-See external docs/research/phase-6b5-d06-srv02 for source diff, implementation/safety,
-unsigned build evidence, receipt schema and separately gated hardware plan.
-https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/api/d3d11/nf-d3d11-id3d11view-getresource
-https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/api/unknwn/nf-unknwn-iunknown-queryinterface%28refiid_void%29
+Build creates a fresh ignored unsigned x64 APPX only. Nine unsafe preprocessor
+configurations must reject; no target executable is run by any verifier.
+
+Receipt v6 binds case, source/build, frozen baselines, package identity, distinct
+process/run UUIDs, six payload hashes, device/texture/SRV HRESULTs and descriptors,
+GetDevice output, two QI HRESULTs/nonnull flags, canonical equality, release order,
+app-memory samples, deadline and terminal result. Sequence: STARTED1,
+BEFORE_CREATE_DEVICE2, BEFORE_CREATE_TEXTURE3, BEFORE_CREATE_SRV4,
+BEFORE_GET_DEVICE5, FINAL6. LocalState/NativeCapabilityReceipts/D06-SRV03-<run>.json.
+
+PASS requires hardware-only successful prerequisites and matching descriptors,
+nonnull GetDevice output, S_OK/nonnull canonical identities, equality, scoped
+cleanup and memory/deadline compliance. Failed/null/mismatched outputs are FAILED;
+prerequisite/persistence unavailable is BLOCKED; late/native exception attribution
+or timeout can be INCONCLUSIVE as specified by reason; NOT EXECUTED is distinct.
+Formal hardware acceptance additionally requires retrieved terminal bytes, pinned
+payload verification and exact run/photo association. Synthetic fixtures are not
+hardware results. Receipt write cap128KiB, lock wait100ms, 10s observation deadline,
+256MiB preflight headroom, max64MiB sampled growth. Startup hash/write precedes timer.
+No cancellation of blocked native/GPU/file calls or hard driver time bound claimed.
+
+API contract: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/api/d3d11/nf-d3d11-id3d11devicechild-getdevice
+Signing, installation, one launch, retrieval, acceptance and cleanup each gated.
